        },
        {
            "+content": "In western Tokyo, there is a massive \"academy city.\" In this city, where approximately 80% of residents are students, a special curriculum for developing psychic abilities is in place, and students' abilities are evaluated on a six-level scale from Level 0 to Level 5. Behind this tranquility lies a \"dark side\" organization that undertakes dirty work never revealed to the public. \"ITEM\" - an elite unit composed of four girls. Saiai Kinuhata, who can freely manipulate nitrogen to provide an impenetrable defense. Frenda Seivelun, who uses explosives and traps to toy with the battlefield. Rikō Takitsubo, who can read and track the faint powers emitted by ability users. Shizuri Mugino, one of only seven Level 5s in Academy City. Then, a fifth girl appears before them. Their encounter with her leads the \"items\" into a new darkness. <em class=de-emphasized>(from manga)</em>",
            "+@type": "Plot Summary"
        },
